              changes only affect future orders — past commissions are locked in.
              Run coupon sync after changing the discount.
            </p>

            <p className="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-sans text-[#64717a] mt-6 mb-2">
              Monthly sales bonus
